Files vendored (with small edits to remove torch / networkx / NER / constituency /
coref imports, and relative imports):
  stanza_ort/doc.py              from stanza/models/common/doc.py
  stanza_ort/stanza_object.py    from stanza/models/common/stanza_object.py
  stanza_ort/_utils.py           from stanza/models/common/utils.py (MISC whitespace helpers)
  stanza_ort/chuliu_edmonds.py   from stanza/models/common/chuliu_edmonds.py
  stanza_ort/head_constraints.py from stanza/models/depparse/head_constraints.py
  stanza_ort/_tokregex.py        regular expressions from stanza/models/tokenization/{utils,data}.py

Files ported (logic re-implemented on numpy / onnxruntime, following the Stanza code):
  stanza_ort/tokenizer.py   stanza/models/tokenization/{data,utils}.py, pipeline/tokenize_processor.py
  stanza_ort/seq2seq.py     stanza/models/mwt/{trainer,character_classifier}.py,
                            stanza/models/common/{seq2seq_model,seq2seq_modules}.py,
                            stanza/models/lemma/{trainer,edit}.py
  stanza_ort/tagger.py      stanza/models/pos/{data,trainer}.py, stanza/models/depparse/{data,model}.py,
                            stanza/models/common/{char_model,pretrain,utils}.py
  stanza_ort/vocab.py       stanza/models/common/vocab.py
  stanza_ort/pipeline.py    stanza/pipeline/{core,processor,mwt,pos,lemma,depparse}_processor.py

The model weights are Stanza's English models (converted by convert.py), distributed under the
terms Stanza's model files carry.
